      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "REFPACKS 1.0.0 \u2014 LTXV 0.9.8 experimental test demo (not official model support). Select local model, encoder, VAE and image. Save refuses collisions by default; enable overwrite on reruns, or replace preparation+save with Load RefPack to reuse a cached file. LTXV: first-image/prefix guidance only, not H3-style identity/outfit conditioning. Flux 2: chain additional compatible packs via Add RefPack for multiple reference images.\n\nThis is a minimal single-pass 8-step distilled example, not the official multi-scale upscale pipeline. Its sigma values follow the distilled schedule. Keep the sampler/decode configuration from your established LTXV tutorial for direct comparisons. Connect length as a frame count; native LTXV rounds to 8n+1."
      ]
    }
